- dari air, Trish!
- Kembali!

824
01:09:04,098 --> 01:09:06,892
- Hentikan pesawatya!
- Keluar dari air!

825
01:09:06,976 --> 01:09:08,477
Trish, Tidak!

826
01:09:08,561 --> 01:09:10,604
Hentikan pesawatnya!

827
01:09:39,508 --> 01:09:40,759
Oh Tuhan tolong.

828
01:10:48,276 --> 01:10:50,528
Astaga, Trish.

829
01:10:53,374 --> 01:10:54,833
Jangan Trish!

830
01:10:56,752 --> 01:10:58,462
Kumohon Trish!

831
01:11:00,556 --> 01:11:02,224
Tidak!

832
01:11:15,529 --> 01:11:16,780
Kumohon jangan tinggalkan aku!

833
01:11:18,899 --> 01:11:20,859
Trish, Jangan tinggalkan aku!

834
01:11:22,611 --> 01:11:24,304
Jangan tinggalkan aku disini.

835
01:13:53,971 --> 01:13:55,430
Kau juga terjebak.

836
01:14:04,665 --> 01:14:06,041
Setidaknya kau sudah berusaha.

837
01:14:24,301 --> 01:14:25,218
Baiklah.

838
01:16:24,179 --> 01:16:25,213
