839
01:16:28,784 --> 01:16:29,834
Apapun yang terjadi.

840
01:17:29,261 --> 01:17:30,428
Apa itu anti air?

841
01:17:33,548 --> 01:17:34,549
Bagaimana menurutmu?

842
01:17:39,354 --> 01:17:40,405
Maddie.

843
01:17:40,914 --> 01:17:43,708
Kita adalah petarung bukan?

844
01:17:46,745 --> 01:17:48,071
Kita memang begitu.

845
01:17:49,939 --> 01:17:51,691
Pilihan apa lagi yang
kita punya?

846
01:19:36,229 --> 01:19:37,147
Trish.

847
01:19:42,694 --> 01:19:43,570
Baiklah.

848
01:19:52,204 --> 01:19:53,663
Ayolah.

849
01:20:00,629 --> 01:20:01,713
Tidak.

